    "body": "您好，\r\n\r\n首先，感谢您的issue。AniRena.com 项目看起来棒极了 and you inspire me。\r\nanimeTackerList是从readme中公示的BT网站采集整理收录的。\r\n这说明它们中某些magnet包含了AniRena的tracker和它们已经把torrent上传到了AniRena.com。\r\n根据我的推断，可能是源自nyaa.si上的magnet使用了AniRena的trackers造成的。\r\nanimeTackerList没有办法做到torrent上传，\r\n它更多是采集tracker的URL地址，并测试它们的链接是否通畅和速度是否足够快，\r\n它没有办法对单一特定的torrent进行测试，工作量将会非常巨大。\r\nAniRena tracker很优秀，所以自动添加到了animeTackerList。\r\nanimeTackerList是作为tracker推广，帮助BT爱好者提供更多尝试的机会。\r\n我将会考虑在其他项目提供自动化上传torrent的功能。\r\n\r\n然后，AniRena有不用上传torrent文件直接增加magnet的支持吗？如果有，希望告知我使用方法。\r\n\r\n最后，我可以对AniRena进行采集用于animeTackerList吗？我会把它添加到readme当中。\r\n如果您不希望animeTackerList将AniRena tracker添加到列表中，可以对我反馈。\r\n\r\n期待您的答复。\r\n\r\n親切的問候。\r\nRaXianch\r\n\r\n======\r\n\r\nHi,\r\n\r\nFirst of all, thank you for your issue. The AniRena.com project looks great and you inspire me.\r\nanimeTackerList is collected and collected from the BT website published in the readme.\r\nThis means that some of them include AniRena tracker and they have uploaded the torrent to AniRena.com.\r\nAccording to my inference, it may be caused by the magnet on nyaa.si using AniRena trackers.\r\nanimeTackerList has no way to do torrent upload,\r\nIt is more about collecting tracker URL addresses and testing whether their links are smooth and fast enough.\r\nIt has no way to test a single specific torrent, the workload will be huge.\r\nAniRena tracker is excellent, so it is automatically added to my listing.\r\nanimeTackerList is promoted as a tracker to help BT enthusiasts provide more opportunities to try.\r\nI will consider providing automatic uploading of torrents in other projects.\r\n\r\nThen, does AniRena add magnet support directly without uploading torrent files? If so, I hope to inform me how to use it.\r\n\r\nFinally, can I collect AniRena for animeTackerList? I will add it to the readme.\r\nIf you don't want animeTackerList to add AniRena tracker to the listing, you can give me feedback.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your reply.\r\n\r\nKind regards.\r\n\r\nRaXianch",
